  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular wastewater initiative in Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The partnership executes an innovative, natural, robust and easy to operate wastewater treatment and compost plant. It will be able to transform waste materials at community level, producing high quality hygienic compost that can be sold and irrigation water that can be used in horti- and agriculture. These revenues can be used for re-investments for the operation and maintenance of the plant.</narrative>
  </description>
